{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52517","headline":"题龙湖 · 陈元光","name":"题龙湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"环堤森雾伏，璧水湛天枢。\n带雨金龙甲，朝天锦鲤鱼。\n楼船摇月监，阁鼓肃冰壶。\n扣枻歌三叠，飞觞泻百枯。\n犀燃神鬼泣，剑射斗牛虚。\n怀古标遐轨，龙湖第一途。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}